## 4. Phase Transition Roadmap

- **Phase B (When `PRE_CODEX_STATE=READY`)**:
  - Skip revalidating PRE_CODEX.
  - Await `CODEX_HIGH_ONCE` result while maintaining candidate-independent preparation.
- **Phase C (When `READY_FOR_PHYSICAL_RUN=YES`)**:
  - Bind authoritative `FINAL_SHA` into [`RUNTIME_SOURCE_BINDING.json`](file:///Users/user/Downloads/2026-courier/scripts/run1_physical/RUNTIME_SOURCE_BINDING.json).
  - Freeze command/evidence packet.
  - Exactly one designated physical `RUN_1` owner executes; other slots support evidence capture only.
- **Phase D (After `RUN_1 PASS`)**:
  - Immediately activate physical `RUN_2` restart execution under single-owner lock.
- **Phase E (After `RUN_2 PASS`)**:
  - Finalize Core Freeze closure, generate signed Proof Cards, capture resource/observability evidence, and proceed to pilot preparation.
